Create.c registers _XtResourceConfigurationEH as an XtEventHandler
through a cast, and XtDispatchEventToWidget calls it with an event
handler's four arguments; it takes three. wasm checks an indirect call's
type, so every Xt program trapped at its shell's first PropertyNotify.
The handler takes the fourth argument, unused.

